# Shell scripts must keep LF and batch files CRLF, whatever the checkout system.
# Batch files are kept byte for byte as stored (CRLF): with "text eol=crlf"
# git wanted them LF inside the repo, and a CRLF one uploaded from the web
# looked changed in every clone, which stopped git pull from rBrowser2 auto-updates.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat -text
